== Walkthrough ==
You say, 'Hail, kerran tseq'

: Kerran tseq says, 'Errr.  You smell funny.  You bring us [toy]?'

You say, 'toy'

: Kerran tseq says, 'Nasty heretics use nasty spells to make bones walk! They merrrely [abandon] them anyway. You go, bring us heretic toy. You not come back or we eat you and then you die like short one.'

You say, 'abandon'

: Kerran tseq says, 'Yes yes. Abandon by drrruid stones. Forrrgotten toys.'

''' You have been assigned the task 'Heretic's Toy'. ''' <br>
A particularly fiery Kerran Tseq in the village on Kerra Isle has strongly recommended that you bring him a "toy" from Toxxulia Forest. From his descriptionm it sounds like the toy may actually be animated bones found somewhere near the Druid ring.

=== Quest Stage 1: ===
* Step - Smash a heretic's pet and gather up the remains
* Text - Smash an abandoned heretic's pet and gather its remains

A structure just East of the Druid Rings spawns multiple abandoned heretic pets. Kill some and get a toy.

